WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.434
Postgres in one

00:00:01.246 --> 00:00:02.460
file no Docker

00:00:02.272 --> 00:00:02.838
needed

00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:05.665
minipg packages PostgreSQL

00:00:05.489 --> 00:00:06.361
as a single

00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:07.092
executable

00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:08.481
A dot pgdb

00:00:08.292 --> 00:00:09.330
folder holds the

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:10.497
data config

00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:12.266
credentials and Postgres

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:12.738
version

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.142
It embeds the

00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:15.487
official Postgres eighteen

00:00:15.298 --> 00:00:16.300
Alpine image

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:17.173
and runs it

00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:18.116
through h9

00:00:18.353 --> 00:00:19.472
a Zig library

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:20.486
whose Plan 9

00:00:20.298 --> 00:00:21.371
kernel answers the

00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:22.126
system calls

00:00:22.197 --> 00:00:23.234
so no Linux

00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:23.953
kernel boots

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.908
Tools like psql

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.580
start in their

00:00:26.404 --> 00:00:27.595
own tiny machine

00:00:27.406 --> 00:00:28.278
in about 90

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.033
milliseconds

00:00:29.222 --> 00:00:30.436
though Postgres runs

00:00:30.248 --> 00:00:31.321
about two times

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.217
slower than native

00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:33.043
for one client

00:00:33.582 --> 00:00:34.596
Full story on

00:00:34.407 --> 00:00:35.303
the dashboard
